{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-14","kind":"proposition","title":"垂直同一直线的两个平面互相平行","englishTitle":"Planes to which the same straight line is at right angles will be parallel.","book":11,"number":14,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.14","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.14/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":14,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-14@raw-d24c2e9543c7cc38","contentId":"euclid-11-14","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d24c2e9543c7cc38ae0cf3451610af2ab0b1477b58e5938907f1bf68781ca5d3","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-14.statement","euclid-11-14.construction.1","euclid-11-14.proof.1","euclid-11-14.construction.2","euclid-11-14.construction.3","euclid-11-14.proof.2","euclid-11-14.proof.3","euclid-11-14.proof.4","euclid-11-14.proof.5","euclid-11-14.conclusion","euclid-11-14.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-14.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-14","revisionId":"euclid-11-14@raw-d24c2e9543c7cc38","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3cd4d91f4b4fd98a831b71e10241cd0cc2e9067a7cc31366707c61140f095c9c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Planes to which the same straight line is at right angles will be parallel."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"平面线线线为直角,将平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-14.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-14","revisionId":"euclid-11-14@raw-d24c2e9543c7cc38","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dba5705507432f216f6c7b8db998330e21b78588c0ac71d6b46890d41c17ec7a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let any straight line AB be at right angles to each of the planes CD, EF; I say that the planes are parallel."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"任何一条AB直线,在平面 CD EF中,每条线以直角分线为准;我说,平面分线是平行的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-14.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-14","revisionId":"euclid-11-14@raw-d24c2e9543c7cc38","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"471db9ffc0a8eb461e462e169e99c35d55309c114a88073dd8088f1ffc8653c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if not, they will meet when produced."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"否则,它们将在宽展时相交。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-14.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-14","revisionId":"euclid-11-14@raw-d24c2e9543c7cc38","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2c9814fb0c6e45c89ac8cc3ca15f2cd75d59f19495085c99da519169301e08a3","citations":["euclid-11-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let them meet; they will then make, as common section, a straight line. [[XI. 3](/principles/euclid-11-3)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们互相交错,然后,它们以一条正线为共同的一条线。 [[XI. 3](/principles/euclid-11-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-14.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-11-14","revisionId":"euclid-11-14@raw-d24c2e9543c7cc38","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3fd861a83ed38cda585f67e8d629408cc37ae0831f82a156f05d9999a6d780a6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let them make GH; let a point K be taken at random on GH, and let AK, BK be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们做GH;让K点随机在GH点,让AK,BK连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-14.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-14","revisionId":"euclid-11-14@raw-d24c2e9543c7cc38","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1cd6917e25ddfc4e2d427a48cc53debf66a1487ab99d1833e908640e995afb61","citations":["euclid-11-def-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since AB is at right angles to the plane EF, therefore AB is also at right angles to BK which is a straight line in the plane EF produced; [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)] therefore the angle ABK is right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于AB是直角到平面 EF,AB也是直角到BK,这是平面 EF延伸的一条直线,因此角度ABK是正确的。 [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-14.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-14","revisionId":"euclid-11-14@raw-d24c2e9543c7cc38","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ff1597431a338e444d902edaaa3102d1d1d3dc29fd7e6d8a9fdda98854e33c1b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the angle BAK is also right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,BAK的角度也是对的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-14.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-14","revisionId":"euclid-11-14@raw-d24c2e9543c7cc38","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2d6d1abe87cb7b4fef6c4dff57b581cec31df6ff73f9aa25311a4127dd5b2d94","citations":["euclid-1-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus, in the triangle ABK, the two angles ABK, BAK are equal to two right angles: which is impossible. [[I. 17](/principles/euclid-1-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在三角形ABK中,两个角度ABK,BAK等于两个直角:这是不可能的。 [[I. 17](/principles/euclid-1-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-14.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-11-14","revisionId":"euclid-11-14@raw-d24c2e9543c7cc38","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4363ea25a8c2c0c399dacb608ad450f1e5b0a209615597ea01a70ddfa60ced47","citations":["euclid-11-def-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the planes CD, EF will not meet when produced; therefore the planes CD, EF are parallel. [[XI. Def. 8](/principles/euclid-11-def-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,平面 CD,EF在延长时不会相互相交;因此,平面 CD,EF是平行的。 [[XI. Def. 8](/principles/euclid-11-def-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-14.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-14","revisionId":"euclid-11-14@raw-d24c2e9543c7cc38","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d0fc798e83ce32564e245d15546a3d18fa35fc8f077cc1f62e2f912e57f235ac","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore planes to which the same straight line is at right angles are parallel. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,平面线线(同一直线为直角)是平行的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-14.source","contentId":"euclid-11-14","revisionId":"euclid-11-14@raw-d24c2e9543c7cc38","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"123318f04493108bfcc75cf74a0ff04a6cad44924127a7be36d83e0d412d3542","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"pr